Subject: [PATCH] inputdispatcher: retain hosted task authority through focus changes

The Wayland seat supplies a WM task Binder identity and an epoch. Keep stock
FocusResolver, channel ordering, cancellation and repeat policy, while limiting
keyboard focus to authoritative task membership. Publish membership with SF
window metadata under the dispatcher lock; retain scope on repeats/fallbacks.

